on-arrival: pps_in_government = 1; npr_in_government = 1; psl_w_in_government = 1; psl_p_in_government = 1

Who should be prime minister?

- @daszynski
- @witos
- @thugutt

@witos
title: Let the PSL-P have the prime ministry.
subtitle: Wincenty Witos will be the prime minister, this is also the preferred candidate of the PSL-W.
on-arrival: prime_minister_party = "PSL-P"; prime_minister = "Witos"
go-to: ministries

@thugutt
title: Let the PSL-W have the prime ministry.
subtitle: Stanisław Thugutt will be the prime minister, This is an unexpected choice, however this may bring the PSL-P closer to the left.
on-arrival: prime_minister_party = "PSL-W"; prime_minister = "Thugutt"; psl_w_relation += 5; psl_w_left += 1; psl_p_left += 2
go-to: ministries

@daszynski
title: Ignacy Daszyński for prime minister.
subtitle: This is our preferred choice, however, our coalition partners may have qualms over a socialist in the prime ministry.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
on-arrival: prime_minister_party = "PPS"; prime_minister = "Daszyński"; leverage -= 10
go-to: ministries

@stapinski
title: Can we convince them to let the PSL-L have the prime ministry?
subtitle: He could be a good left-agrarian prime minister.

- @accept_stapinski
- @reject_stapinski
- @second_thought

@second_thought
title: On second thought...

- @daszynski
- @witos
- @thugutt
- @stapinski

@accept
title: sure
on-arrival: prime_minister_party = "PSL-L"; prime_minister = "Stapiński"; leverage -= 3; psl_p_left += 2; psl_w_left += 2; socialism += 5; psl_l_relation += 5
go-to: ministries

they accept blah blahh text Jan Stapiński will be their prime minister

@reject_stapinski
title: Not accept

wip pick another

- @daszynski
- @witos
- @thugutt

@ministries

We can pick from any number of ministries. Controlling a ministry allows us to directly effect policy in that area. [? if in_left_front : Any ministry that we do not take will be given to the KPD. ?] [? if in_left_front and reichswehr_minister_party == "KPD" : If the KPD controls the Reichswehr Ministry, the army will most likely revolt. ?]

- #mins_1928
- #drop_mins_1928

@labor
title: Labor Ministry
subtitle: Taking the Labor Ministry is expected of us.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
tags: mins_1928
choose-if: leverage >= 5
view-if: labor_minister_party != "PPS"
on-arrival: leverage -= 5; labor_minister_party = "PPS"; labor_minister = "Ziemięcki"
go-to: ministries

Bronisław Ziemięcki of the PPS has been appointed labor minister.

@interior
title: Interior Ministry
subtitle: The Interior Ministry controls domestic security and general administration.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
tags: mins_1928
choose-if: leverage >= 10
view-if: interior_minister_party != "PPS"
on-arrival: leverage -= 10: interior_minister_party = "PPS"; interior_minister = "No info"
go-to: ministries

Carl Severing of the SPD has been appointed Interior Minister.

@publicworks
title: Public Works Ministry
subtitle: The Public Works Ministry focuses on constructing projects and recovering post-partition.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
tags: mins_1928
choose-if: leverage >= 5
view-if: publicworks_minister_party != "PPS"
on-arrival: leverage -= 5; publicworks_minister_party = "PPS"; publicworks_minister = "Barlicki"
go-to: ministries

Norbert Barlicki of the PPS has been appointed Public Works Minister.

