@no_more
title: No more ministries.
subtitle: [? if leverage >= 10 : We still have some more leverage to gain ministries. ?][? if leverage < 10 : We do not have much leverage left. ?]
tags: mins_1928
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.military_minister_party == "Vacant") {
    Q.military_minister = "Sosnowski";
}
if (Q.publicworks_minister_party == "Vacant") {
    Q.publicworks_minister = "Narutowicz";
} else if (Q.narutowicz_dead == 1) {
    Q.publicworks_minister = "Rybczyński";
}
!}

This coalition arrangement is tolerable to all.

